From 6d922c7e202a3cd0984d615f14cba8ab55f791c2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: JimmyBlunt <jo@paso-music.de>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 00:31:45 +1000
Subject: [PATCH 2/8] Add FastLED compile client, artifact cache and
 fastledStore (local #9002)

- fastledCompileClient.ts: POST /compile {source, defines} to the local
  FastLED compile service (default http://127.0.0.1:9996, per-tab override
  ?fastledService=), base64 wasm decode, diagnostics normalised to 1-based
  Pattern lines (header diagnostics land on line 1 with file:line), offline
  classification, /health probe.
- fastledArtifactCache.ts: LRU of compiled WebAssembly.Modules (and failures)
  keyed by (source, defines).
- fastledStore.ts: debounced, superseding edit compiles; only a successful
  compile of the still-current buffer of the same Pattern publishes
  previewSource (compileStatus good); errors set broken and keep the last
  working preview; a reopened unexecutable source becomes unavailable.
  Offline: compileStatus untouched, serviceStatus offline, retry with backoff.
- patternStore.updatePatternControls: sparse-merge persisted Control values
  into PatternRecord.controls (controls_json), no updatedAt bump.

Pre-commit hook checks run manually (hook cannot spawn npx.cmd on Windows/Node 24):
npm run lint, check:e2e-coverage, check:e2e-locators, tsc -b (tsconfig + node),
vitest fastledStore + patternStore + src/engine/fastled (57 passed).

